1
00:00:00,935 --> 00:00:03,605
I think they say “junk.”

2
00:00:04,973 --> 00:00:07,803
(Arthur:)What is happening to this world?

3
00:00:09,043 --> 00:00:13,183
What-what do you
actually need to know?

4
00:00:14,616 --> 00:00:17,116
(Sheldon:)This is an important night
for us,

5
00:00:17,118 --> 00:00:19,888
(Sheldon:)and I'm worried
I might be overwhelmed

6
00:00:19,887 --> 00:00:22,217
(Sheldon:)and ruin everything.

7
00:00:23,391 --> 00:00:26,991
Sheldon, if-if you're
with the right person,

8
00:00:26,995 --> 00:00:29,625
it-it'll be okay.

9
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:34,236
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Arthur.

10
00:00:34,235 --> 00:00:37,405
(Sheldon:)You are the wisest of the wise.

11
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:40,075
Well, that's-that's very nice
of you to say,

12
00:00:40,074 --> 00:00:42,674
(Arthur:)but I think
I'm just an expression of...

13
00:00:42,677 --> 00:00:45,647
(Arthur:)of your unconscious mind.

14
00:00:45,647 --> 00:00:48,217
Oh, sure. Yeah.

15
00:00:48,216 --> 00:00:52,316
(Sheldon:)Well, you're fun to look at.

16
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:57,260
Tonight's the night!

17
00:00:57,258 --> 00:00:59,228
(Leonard:)Yeah, the wait
is finally over!

